/repos/h516df/Jiaoban/zipball/v0.5","body":"## 交办 v0.5\n\n**覆盖安装即可，旧记录保留。**\n\n### 新增\n- 按人看：右上角「⋯」→ 按人看，点一个人就能看到他交代过的所有事，办完和过期的也在里面\n- 按人看里能看到每个人手上几件、过期几件，谁的事最多排最前面\n\n### 改进\n- 真机量了一轮手感：滑动和打字都是顺的，卡顿只集中在启动那一秒\n- 顺手确认了正式版比调试版快好几倍（同一场景最长一帧 263 毫秒 对 1361 毫秒），所以一直给你装正式版\n\n### 说明\n- 升级不会丢数据：同一个签名覆盖安装，旧记录都在\n- 启动那一秒的长帧主要来自系统还没把代码编译好（刚装完的第一次最明显）；手机上装完用一会儿会明显好转\n- 量出来的数字来自模拟器（软件渲染），绝对值不代表你的手机\n\nSHA256: `8d2f130774396dbcef00be1737da56c91a35d737383bd6063a6b4cf76adc2b22`\n\n数据只存在手机本地，不联网、不注册；只有点「检查更新」时才联网。"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/h516df/Jiaoban/releases/409598575","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/h516df/Jiaoban/releases/409598575/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/h516df/Jiaoban/releases/409598575/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/h516df/Jiaoban/releases/tag/v0.4","id":409598575,"author":{"login":"h516df","id":155412647,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUNopw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155412647?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df","html_url":"https://github.com/h516df","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/h516df/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOVEXi5s4Yafpv","tag_name":"v0.4","target_commitish":"main","name":"交办 v0.4｜小改动","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-11T09:57:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T10:34:35Z","published_at":"2026-1